    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795750/extras/a31cbee9168e78c895667809d2b3104f.avif?t=1754060000\" width=600 height=88 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795750/extras/c1ba13b250d5ae29db3356934735ebc7.poster.webp?t=1754060000\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795750/extras/c1ba13b250d5ae29db3356934735ebc7.webp?t=1754060000\" class=\"bb_img\" width=600 height=200 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on a relaxing yet mind-bending journey through thousands of uniquely designed mazes. From classic square puzzles to complex circular, triangular, and even hexagonal labyrinths\u2014experience a truly diverse and enchanting experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your path through combinations of maze shapes, sizes, and game modes. Whether you're looking for a calming puzzle break or a strategic challenge, there's something here for every mood.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Creative Level Design: Conquer 4 maze types\u2014square, circular, triangular, and hexagonal</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 5 Unique Challenges: Classic, Portal, Token, Limited Moves, Timed and Dark Mazes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Power-ups: 3 helpful powers to help you find your way</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Satisfying puzzles: Enjoy a peaceful session with small mazes, or test your skills on advanced ones</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Unique Shapes: Explore mazes shaped like fish, guitars, trees, and more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Beautiful Design: Vivid colors and soothing music create a visually and emotionally engaging experience</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock constellations of puzzles, discover secret paths, and lose yourself in the ultimate maze adventure.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795750/extras/a31cbee9168e78c895667809d2b3104f.avif?t=1754060000\" width=600 height=88 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795750/extras/c1ba13b250d5ae29db3356934735ebc7.poster.webp?t=1754060000\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795750/extras/c1ba13b250d5ae29db3356934735ebc7.webp?t=1754060000\" class=\"bb_img\" width=600 height=200 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on a relaxing yet mind-bending journey through thousands of uniquely designed mazes. From classic square puzzles to complex circular, triangular, and even hexagonal labyrinths\u2014experience a truly diverse and enchanting experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your path through combinations of maze shapes, sizes, and game modes. Whether you're looking for a calming puzzle break or a strategic challenge, there's something here for every mood.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Creative Level Design: Conquer 4 maze types\u2014square, circular, triangular, and hexagonal</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 5 Unique Challenges: Classic, Portal, Token, Limited Moves, Timed and Dark Mazes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Power-ups: 3 helpful powers to help you find your way</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Satisfying puzzles: Enjoy a peaceful session with small mazes, or test your skills on advanced ones</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Unique Shapes: Explore mazes shaped like fish, guitars, trees, and more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Beautiful Design: Vivid colors and soothing music create a visually and emotionally engaging experience</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock constellations of puzzles, discover secret paths, and lose yourself in the ultimate maze adventure.</p>",
    "short_description": "Discover a universe of mazes in one mesmerizing game.",
